# F-08: leave EMPTY so the browser calls the API same-origin through nginx (/api/v1/...).
# Same-origin is required for the refresh cookie's SameSite=strict to be sent, and it is the
# CSRF control for the cookie-authenticated /auth routes. Set an absolute cross-origin URL only
# if you also relax SameSite -- which reintroduces the CSRF exposure F-08 closed.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
# Used only for server-side rendering; defaults to NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL if unset.
# Under docker compose this must be the api service's Docker-network name.
API_INTERNAL_URL=http://localhost:8000
